Performance Manager generic Rill Runtime
========================================

Performance Manager does not vendor or build a Rill adapter. The optional
`performance-manager-rill` package consumes the separately owned
`rill-runtime` package, which installs `/usr/bin/rill-runtime`. The exact
Runtime source, package, license and transitive dependency notices are owned
and published by `hello-yunshu/rill-openwrt-packages` and its upstream RillML
release. This repository records only the pinned dependency and qualification
identity in `contracts/rill-runtime.json`.

Historical adapter snapshots, where retained under `contracts/upstream/` or
`docs/history/`, are audit fixtures only and are not active package payloads.
